<div class="page-content">
        <div class="section section-z-top " id="section-overview" >
    <span class=section-id id="overview"></span><div class="bg"></div>
    <section>
      <div class="row none">
    <div class="column_8 ">
                <h2 class="heading section_title ">Your Gateway to Capital, Liquidity and Visibility</h2>








<div data-six-textimage="right" class="textimage ">
    <div class="">
                    <div><p>If you are looking to list your securities and products on an exchange that offers extraordinary liquidity, features some of Europe’s biggest companies by market capitalisation and stands out for its reliability, trustworthiness and stability, then welcome to the Swiss Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The Swiss Stock Exchange is currently the third largest in Europe, with a free float market capitalization of CHF 1.8 trillion (as per mid-2024). Around 250 companies of all sizes and sectors, including small and mid-caps, family businesses and international giants benefit from being listed on the Swiss Stock Exchange.</p></div></div>
        </div></div>
    <div class="column_4 ">
                <ul class="link-list link_list css" data-six-layout="dropdown">

        <li class="js"><a href="">Quick Access</a></li>
        <li >
            <a class="link-list__link" href="https://www.six-group.com/en/market-data.html">Market Data</a></li>
        <li >
            <a class="link-list__link" href="https://www.six-group.com/en/contacts/swiss-stock-exchange.html#c=/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-topic/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing">Contacts</a></li>
        <li >
            <a class="link-list__link" href="https://www.six-group.com/en/products-services/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing/download-center.html">Download Center</a></li>
        </ul>

      




<div class="figure featured cta ">
 
    <div class="clearfix">
        
        <div class="cell">
            <div class="paragraph_title">Subscribe to Our Reports &amp; Newsletters</div>
            <p>Get the latest updates and insights from the Swiss Stock Exchange.</p>
            
    
    
    <a class="buttonlink" href="https://www.six-group.com/en/services/newsletter/the-swiss-stock-exchange.html" target="_self">
        
        Sign up Now
    </a>

        </div>
    </div>
</div></div>
    </div>

</section>
    </div>
<div class="section section-z-top " id="section-services" >
    <span class=section-id id="services"></span><div class="bg"></div>
    <section>
      


    <div class="heading description ">How can we help you?</div>



















    <h2 class="heading section_title ">Discover Our Services</h2>








<div class="page-list-subpages">
    <div class="list2 list-box list-image-top  list-horizontal-24-24-24-24-24 list-title-bigger " data-six-hide=".item" >

    <ul >
      <li class="item clearfix " data-six-item-id="/content/six/global/en/products-services/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing/equities"
    data-six-tags="/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/contacts/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing-general-inquiries/primary-markets,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-topic/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/offering/the-swiss-stock-exchange/equities,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-unit/the-swiss-stock-exchange" data-page-view-count="">
    <a href="https://www.six-group.com/en/products-services/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing/equities.html"><div class="img">
      <img alt="Equities" data-six-img='{"path":"https://www.six-group.com/dam/images/the-swiss-stock-exchange/Header/equties-v2-2026.six-image.[FORMAT].[WIDTH].jpg","standard":[80,160,240,510,720,1020,1250]}'></div>
<div class="cell">
    
    <h3 class="teaser-title">Equities</h3>

<p>The Swiss Stock Exchange is your ideal partner for issuing equity, the publisher of the SMI and Europe’s leading life sciences exchange.</p>
        <span class="teaser-link">Find Out More</span>
    </div></a></li>
<li class="item clearfix " data-six-item-id="/content/six/global/en/products-services/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing/bonds"
    data-six-tags="/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/contacts/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing-general-inquiries/bonds-listing,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-topic/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/offering/the-swiss-stock-exchange/bonds,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-unit/the-swiss-stock-exchange" data-page-view-count="">
    <a href="https://www.six-group.com/en/products-services/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing/bonds.html"><div class="img">
      <img alt="Bonds" data-six-img='{"path":"https://www.six-group.com/dam/images/the-swiss-stock-exchange/Header/bonds-listing.six-image.[FORMAT].[WIDTH].jpg","standard":[80,160,240,510,720,1020,1250,1920,2560]}'></div>
<div class="cell">
    
    <h3 class="teaser-title">Bonds</h3>

<p>With the Swiss Stock Exchange, you benefit from a debt capital market that is both large and truly international. Almost half of our listed bonds are issued by foreign issuers from around 40 jurisdictions across 5 continents.</p>
        <span class="teaser-link">Find Out More</span>
    </div></a></li>
<li class="item clearfix " data-six-item-id="/content/six/global/en/products-services/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing/etfs-etps-and-funds"
    data-six-tags="/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/contacts/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing-general-inquiries/etfs-and-funds,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-topic/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-unit/the-swiss-stock-exchange" data-page-view-count="">
    <a href="https://www.six-group.com/en/products-services/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing/etfs-etps-and-funds.html"><div class="img">
      <img alt="ETFs, ETPs and Funds" data-six-img='{"path":"https://www.six-group.com/dam/images/the-swiss-stock-exchange/Header/etp-etf-fund.six-image.[FORMAT].[WIDTH].png","standard":[80,160,240,510,720,1020,1250,1920]}'></div>
<div class="cell">
    
    <h3 class="teaser-title">ETFs, ETPs and Funds</h3>

<p>With the Swiss Stock Exchange, you get to access one of the world’s most highly capitalized international investor bases</p>
        <span class="teaser-link">Find Out More</span>
    </div></a></li>
<li class="item clearfix " data-six-item-id="/content/six/global/en/products-services/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing/structured-products"
    data-six-tags="/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/contacts/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing-general-inquiries/structured-products,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-topic/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/offering/the-swiss-stock-exchange/structured-products,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-unit/the-swiss-stock-exchange" data-page-view-count="">
    <a href="https://www.six-group.com/en/products-services/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing/structured-products.html"><div class="img">
      <img alt="Structured Products" data-six-img='{"path":"https://www.six-group.com/dam/images/the-swiss-stock-exchange/Header/GettyImages-1014536766.six-image.[FORMAT].[WIDTH].jpg","standard":[80,160,240,510,720,1020,1250,1920,2560]}'></div>
<div class="cell">
    
    <h3 class="teaser-title">Structured Products</h3>

<p>Expand your distribution channels and cut time from issuance to trading by listing structured products with SIX</p>
        <span class="teaser-link">Find Out More</span>
    </div></a></li>
<li class="item clearfix " data-six-item-id="/content/six/global/en/products-services/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing/download-center"
    data-six-tags="" data-page-view-count="">
