    <h2 class="heading section_title ">Latest News</h2>








<div class="page-list-taxonomy">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/etc.clientlibs/ihcc/components/list/base/clientlibs.min.ACSHASHb2cbf8c207838737a64f9713286fba7b.css" type="text/css">
<script src="/etc.clientlibs/ihcc/components/list/base/clientlibs.min.ACSHASHec41fdbd67682f2adfd7b624b88a5cf1.js"></script>
<!-- Start of list -->
<div class="list2 list-box list-image-top  list-horizontal-3-3-3-3 list-title-smaller " data-six-hide=".item" >

    <ul >
      <li class="item clearfix " data-six-item-id="/content/six/global/en/newsroom/news/the-swiss-stock-exchange/2026/from-swiss-cloud-pioneer-to-public-company-infomaniak-lists-six-swiss-exchange" data-six-tags="/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-unit/the-swiss-stock-exchange,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/contacts/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing-general-inquiries/etfs-and-funds,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/content-type/newsroom/news,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-topic/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing" data-page-view-count="">
  <a href="https://www.six-group.com/en/newsroom/news/the-swiss-stock-exchange/2026/from-swiss-cloud-pioneer-to-public-company-infomaniak-lists-six-swiss-exchange.html"><div class="cell">
      
    <h3 class="teaser-title">From Swiss Cloud Pioneer to Public Company: Infomaniak Lists on SIX Swiss Exchange</h3>

<div class="list-teaser-news-date">
          <span>
            <time datetime="2026-10-08">Oct 8, 2026</time>
          </span>
        </div>
      <p>The listing marks an important milestone in the company’s more than 30-year journey and brings a distinctive Swiss technology company to the public market.</p>
        <span class="teaser-link">Show News</span>
      </div></a></li>
<li class="item clearfix " data-six-item-id="/content/six/global/en/newsroom/news/the-swiss-stock-exchange/2026/ipo-or-reverse-merger-choosing-the-right-route-to-the-public-markets" data-six-tags="/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-unit/the-swiss-stock-exchange,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/contacts/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing-general-inquiries,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/content-type/newsroom/news,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-topic/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing" data-page-view-count="">
  <a href="https://www.six-group.com/en/newsroom/news/the-swiss-stock-exchange/2026/ipo-or-reverse-merger-choosing-the-right-route-to-the-public-markets.html"><div class="cell">
      
    <h3 class="teaser-title">IPO or Reverse Merger? Choosing the Right Route to the Public Markets</h3>

<div class="list-teaser-news-date">
          <span>
            <time datetime="2026-09-24">Sep 24, 2026</time>
          </span>
        </div>
      <p>While the traditional IPO remains the preferred path to going public for many companies, reverse mergers can offer an alternative route. At Investora, capital markets experts discussed the opportunities, considerations and success factors companies should evaluate when exploring a stock exchange listing. Sascha Hilber, Head Primary Markets Switzerland at SIX Swiss Exchange, participated in the panel discussion alongside representatives from the ecosystem.  </p>
        <span class="teaser-link">Show News</span>
      </div></a></li>
<li class="item clearfix " data-six-item-id="/content/six/global/en/newsroom/news/the-swiss-stock-exchange/2026/scale-ups-driving-force-behind-switzerlands-growth" data-six-tags="/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-unit/the-swiss-stock-exchange,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/contacts/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing-general-inquiries/etfs-and-funds,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/content-type/newsroom/news,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-topic/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing" data-page-view-count="">
  <a href="https://www.six-group.com/en/newsroom/news/the-swiss-stock-exchange/2026/scale-ups-driving-force-behind-switzerlands-growth.html"><div class="cell">
      
    <h3 class="teaser-title">Scale-Ups: A Driving Force Behind Switzerland’s Growth</h3>

<div class="list-teaser-news-date">
          <span>
            <time datetime="2026-09-16">Sep 16, 2026</time>
          </span>
        </div>
      <p>Switzerland is home to a growing number of innovative companies that are scaling internationally while creating jobs, attracting investment and developing new technologies. The Swiss Scale-up Report 2026 highlights the important role scale-ups play in driving innovation, attracting investment and creating long-term economic value in Switzerland. </p>
        <span class="teaser-link">Show News</span>
      </div></a></li>
<li class="item clearfix " data-six-item-id="/content/six/global/en/newsroom/media-releases/2026/20260915-hansainvest-etf-issuer" data-six-tags="/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-unit/the-swiss-stock-exchange,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/offering/the-swiss-stock-exchange/etfs,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-topic/the-swiss-stock-exchange/trading,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/offering/the-swiss-stock-exchange/etps,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/target-group/media-professional,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/content-type/newsroom/trade-media,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-topic/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/contacts/six/press-office" data-page-view-count="872">
  <a href="https://www.six-group.com/en/newsroom/media-releases/2026/20260915-hansainvest-etf-issuer.html"><div class="cell">
      
    <h3 class="teaser-title">HANSAINVEST Lists BIT Global Technology Leaders UCITS ETF at SIX Swiss Exchange</h3>

<div class="list-teaser-news-date">
          <span>
            <time datetime="2026-09-15">Sep 15, 2026</time>
          </span>
        </div>
      <p>Today, SIX welcomes HANSAINVEST as issuer of Exchange Traded Funds (ETFs) at SIX Swiss Exchange with the listing of the BIT Global Technology Leaders UCITS ETF. The actively managed ETF complies with the EU-directive UCIT and provides investors with access to a global, benchmark-agnostic portfolio of leading technology and AI infrastructure companies. These companies have the potential to benefit significantly from the increasing adoption of artificial intelligence and structural technological change.</p>
        <span class="teaser-link">Show News</span>
      </div></a></li>
</ul>

